--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party model attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of the reasoning prose in the v3 instruction pairs were rewritten
from templated drafts using NVIDIA Nemotron models via the NVIDIA NIM API.

    Licensed by NVIDIA Corporation under the NVIDIA Open Model License

Verdicts, risk tiers, typology labels and all numeric figures were produced
by this repository's own generators and were held fixed during rewriting;
the model altered wording only. Every rewrite was validated against the
source record and rejected on drift.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bank Secrecy Act regulation text: 31 CFR Chapter X, retrieved from the
eCFR API (https://www.ecfr.gov/api). U.S. federal regulations are in the
public domain.

Credit card fraud transactions: ULB/Kaggle public credit card fraud
dataset (DbCL v1.0).
